@startuml F1.6-D02-marcar-lido
title F1.6-D02 — Marcar comunicação como lida
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Aluno" as Aluno
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "CommunicationsController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Aluno -> WebApp: abre comunicação não lida
note right of WebApp
  Só dispara se
  _links.marcar-lido existir
end note

WebApp -> Jwt: POST /communications/:id/read
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: UPDATE read_at\nAND destinatario_id = aluno
Postgres --> Ctrl: OK
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200
WebApp --> Aluno: remove unread dot

@enduml
